      "id": "dashu-c1",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "二十四节气按太阳位置划分一年。",
        "en": "The 24 solar terms divide the year by the Sun's position."
      },
      "region": [
        "中国"
      ],
      "period": "现行口径（GB/T 33661-2017 时代）；机制承自传统历法",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-pmo-almanac-qa",
        "source-hko-solar-terms"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-solarterms-calendar-role"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "dashu-c2",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "大暑是第十二个节气。太阳到达黄经120°，一年中最热的时候。",
        "en": "Dashu is the twelfth term: the Sun reaches 120°. The hottest period of the year."
      },
      "region": [
        "全球（黄经定义与地域无关）；日期经验因纬度而异"
      ],
      "period": "现代天文学口径；2017年起有国家标准表述",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-ihchina-dashu-feature",
        "source-xinhua-dashu-2022"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-dashu-longitude-120"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "dashu-c3",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "大暑是农历六月的\"中气\"。\"伏天\"达到顶点。",
        "en": "Dashu is the mid-term of the sixth lunar month. \"Fu\" heat reaches maximum."
      },
      "region": [
        "中国（气象统计以30余个省会级城市为准；区域差异显著）"
      ],
      "period": "气象数据为1991-2020年常年统计；稿件为2022年",
